From b8bdf9de0c54aeccf07c578303f6c75908b8c33a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: George J Padayatti <george.padayatti@igrant.io>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:47:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/19] Add iGrant.io credential component: OWS
 issuance/verification plugins, cabinet wallet control, demo workflows

- @liquio/event-igrantio-plugin (event-external-service): igrant.issue /
  igrant.verify / igrant.checkStatus / igrant.revoke / igrant.supplyClaims
  against the iGrant.io Organisation Wallet Suite (OpenID4VCI / OpenID4VP)
- @liquio/external-reader-igrantio-plugin (external-reader-provider):
  checkCredentialStatus / checkPresentationStatus polled by the cabinet
- igrant.credential form control (front-core + cabinet override): wallet QR,
  deep link, status polling, auto-advance
- settings register (examples/register-200-200.dat): admin-editable OWS base
  URL + API key, read by both plugins with a 60s cache
- config templates and Helm plugins.json blocks for event and external-reader
- demo workflows: 1002 credential service (verify + issue round trip),
  1003 educational certificate (GovStack education use case shape)
