  dotted providerName fails on the standard decorator); README snippets updated
- add revoke and supplyClaims operations; prefer camelCase credentialExchangeId;
  count credential_issued as an issuance done-status
- IgrantCredential control: send the filters object the /external_reader
  validator requires; restyle as centered card with wallet tick logo in the QR
  (imageSettings excavate) and an Open in EUDI Wallet button
- demo workflows: pre-authorized code flow (userPin) for issuance; static
  institution choice; new educational-certificate example (workflow 1003)
