From b8d03f1a354c2ccf3ef1b1554ff11fb7ae957f33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: George J Padayatti <george.padayatti@igrant.io>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 23:56:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/19] Multi-tenant settingsName, real wallet payment demo,
 branded QR panel

- SettingsResolver resolves named register records (one per tenant/sandbox)
  with a per-name cache; every operation and the reader methods accept
  settingsName; the control forwards it while polling
- workflow 1003 drops the mock payment: the issue event is a dynamic
  credential request with a TS12 payment transactionData and the MoE payment
  presentation definition - pay and receive in one QR
- IgrantCredential QR panel matches the iGrant.io branding: EC level H with
  centred tick logo, Refresh chip, full-width Open in EUDI Wallet button,
  wallet download helper link
